        <body>
            <trans-unit id="iIWC3BD">
                <source>description.guided_project_card_back</source>
                <target>Create a variant of a pack's card back, which players can then win and choose.</target>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="1lnvqC.">
                <source>description.guided_step_card_back_done</source>
                <target>The back is ready: a reward, a purchase or a code gives it by its slug.</target>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="zWKy_oI">
                <source>description.guided_step_card_back_effect</source>
                <target>How the back moves: a slow zoom, stars… Refused when drawn on the same layer as the tone.</target>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="JB9Dqrj">
                <source>description.guided_step_card_back_image</source>
                <target>Card-sized, in portrait. Without one, the back takes the pack's picture.</target>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="oUvgEpU">
                <source>description.guided_step_card_back_name</source>
                <target>Its own name, the pack's being on the back already. The slug is drawn from it.</target>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="ZMGIO0U">
                <source>description.guided_step_card_back_new</source>
                <target>A new variant for a pack's cards.</target>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="HJJbJh0">
                <source>description.guided_step_card_back_open</source>
                <target>The list of variants, pack by pack.</target>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="yRCr_AU">
                <source>description.guided_step_card_back_pack</source>
                <target>The cards of this pack will wear this back once the player chooses it.</target>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="fKPkQe5">
                <source>description.guided_step_card_back_published</source>
                <target>Only a published back can be given and chosen.</target>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="U2U4GGg">
                <source>description.guided_step_card_back_tone</source>
                <target>The light laid over the picture. An effect drawn on the same layer is refused.</target>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="ii3aJ0K">
                <source>help.back_effect</source>
                <target>The back's animation, drawn by the site and its app.</target>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="Fsv4oD6">
                <source>help.back_image</source>
                <target>Card-sized, in portrait. Without one, the back takes its pack's picture, in its tone.</target>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="WgS5NsT">
                <source>help.back_name</source>
                <target>The variant's own name, the pack's being on the back already: “At dawn”, “Sunset”.</target>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="3FgP2nj">
                <source>help.back_pack</source>
                <target>The cards of this pack wear this back once it is chosen.</target>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="Y1neHMB">
                <source>help.back_pack_locked</source>
                <target>Set on creation: a back never moves to another pack, its players would lose it. For another pack, create a new back.</target>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="CV05C_b">
                <source>help.back_pack_typed</source>
                <target>The pack's key as the site names it (a castle's prefix, a set's slug): the cards of this pack wear this back once it is chosen.</target>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="iQyCGJQ">
                <source>help.back_position</source>
                <target>The order of a pack's variants.</target>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="PMnabJO">
                <source>help.back_product_id</source>
                <target>The product's identifier at Apple and Google, empty when the back is not on sale there.</target>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="NPdfLtf">
